485 0 obj
<<
/Title (Limitations: \(i\) the included observations are synthetic, \(ii\) study hours are self-reported, \(iii\) the dashboard is descriptive rather than predictive, \(iv\) the statistical thresholds are exploratory, and \(v\) valid student identifiers are anonymised but the application has no user accounts or access controls. Additionally, grades use a fixed threshold scheme that may not match every institution.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 441 0 R
/Next 486 0 R
>>
endobj
486 0 obj
<<
/Title (Possible extensions include an Add/Edit/Delete Student form, an integrated local database, assignment-specific grade thresholds, time-series tracking across semesters, downloadable summaries, handling of missing values under configurable policies, and richer analysis of possible confounding variables. Any real student dataset should be collected with appropriate consent and managed with privacy safeguards.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 441 0 R
/Prev 485 0 R
>>
endobj
