511 0 obj
<<
/Title (Student records frequently contain assessment marks and estimates of time spent studying. When these records are stored in a spreadsheet, comparing distributions, courses and unusual observations can be time-consuming. A small analytical dashboard can standardise data validation and present useful summaries for exploration.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 483 0 R
/Next 512 0 R
>>
endobj
512 0 obj
<<
/Title (The developed application is a Python desktop interface. It displays key performance indicators, a study-hours-versus-score scatter plot, score and grade distributions, course comparisons, an outlier table, and a written statistical interpretation. Users can work with the preloaded synthetic dataset or import an anonymised CSV file.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 483 0 R
/Prev 511 0 R
>>
endobj
